    "detailed_description": "Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be a roomba on a spaceship? Look no further than DOOMBA! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDOOMBA is a sci-fi cleaning simulator adventure made in Unreal Engine 5. Your job? Clean the infected cargo ship and eliminate the source of the infection. Led along by the snarky ship AI, you'll pick up tools and upgrades along the way. Just be careful- In space, no one can hear you clean.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDOOMBA is the product of three person team MJR- Malachi Franson (Level Design, Programming, Tech Art), Joshua Watson (3D Generalist), and Rees Jackson (Environment Art and Materials) for our Senior Thesis 2024 for the Game Art program at Ringling College of Art and Design.",
    "about_the_game": "Have you ever wondered what it would be like to be a roomba on a spaceship? Look no further than DOOMBA! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDOOMBA is a sci-fi cleaning simulator adventure made in Unreal Engine 5. Your job? Clean the infected cargo ship and eliminate the source of the infection. Led along by the snarky ship AI, you'll pick up tools and upgrades along the way. Just be careful- In space, no one can hear you clean.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDOOMBA is the product of three person team MJR- Malachi Franson (Level Design, Programming, Tech Art), Joshua Watson (3D Generalist), and Rees Jackson (Environment Art and Materials) for our Senior Thesis 2024 for the Game Art program at Ringling College of Art and Design.",
